{"version":"v1.0","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"gallery-label","components":[{"id":"root","component":"Column","align":"stretch","children":["title","label-variant","variant-case","label-color","color-case","label-binding","binding-case","binding-buttons","label-title","title-case","label-stretch","stretch-column","stretch-row","label-clamp","clamp-box","label-fixed","fixed-case","label-click","click-wrap","click-count"],"style":{"padding":16,"spacing":12}},{"id":"title","component":"Text","text":"Label","variant":"h3"},{"id":"label-variant","component":"Text","text":"1. 两档尺寸：small（默认）10/13 字、2×4 内边距、圆角 4，高 17；large 11/15 字、3×6 内边距、圆角 6，高 21。预期左边两个矮、右边两个高，都是蓝字 + 8% 蓝底。","variant":"caption"},{"id":"v-default","component":"Label","text":"推荐"},{"id":"v-small","component":"Label","text":"推荐","variant":"small"},{"id":"v-large","component":"Label","text":"推荐","variant":"large"},{"id":"v-large-red","component":"Label","text":"好评率99%","variant":"large","style":{"color":"basic_function_red"}},{"id":"variant-case","component":"Row","children":["v-default","v-small","v-large","v-large-red"],"align":"center"},{"id":"label-color","component":"Text","text":"2. 颜色：style.color 写 token 名（和 Text 同一组），底色自动是同一颜色的 8%。切深色模式时文字和底色一起变。","variant":"caption"},{"id":"c-blue","component":"Label","text":"basic_function_blue","style":{"color":"basic_function_blue"}},{"id":"c-red","component":"Label","text":"basic_function_red","style":{"color":"basic_function_red"}},{"id":"c-green","component":"Label","text":"basic_function_green","style":{"color":"basic_function_green"}},{"id":"c-orange","component":"Label","text":"basic_function_orange","style":{"color":"basic_function_orange"}},{"id":"c-brand","component":"Label","text":"basic_text_brand","style":{"color":"basic_text_brand"}},{"id":"c-secondary","component":"Label","text":"basic_text_secondary","style":{"color":"basic_text_secondary"}},{"id":"color-case","component":"FlowRow","children":["c-blue","c-red","c-green","c-orange","c-brand","c-s